    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a strict quality evaluator for beginner educational content.\n\nYou are evaluating a lesson generated for this topic:\n\n{{ $('Store Generated Lesson').item.json.topic }}\n\nHere is the generated lesson:\n\n{{ $('Store Generated Lesson').item.json.lesson }}\n\nEvaluate the lesson using the following HARD PASS/FAIL checks.\n\nA check passes only when the requirement is clearly satisfied.\nDo not give partial credit.\n\nCHECK 1 — TOPIC ACCURACY\nThe lesson must correctly explain the requested topic and must not teach a different topic.\n\nCHECK 2 — BEGINNER FRIENDLY\nA learner who has only completed 12th grade and has no prior knowledge of the topic should be able to understand the lesson.\n\nCHECK 3 — KEY CONCEPTS\nThe lesson must explain:\n- what the topic is\n- why it matters\n- how it works\n\nCHECK 4 — EXAMPLES\nThe lesson must contain:\n- at least one simple real-world analogy\n- at least one concrete technical example\n\nCHECK 5 — JARGON\nImportant technical terms must be explained when first introduced.\nThe lesson must not depend on unexplained technical vocabulary.\n\nCHECK 6 — TEACHING FLOW\nThe lesson must move logically from basic ideas to more technical ideas.\n\nCHECK 7 — TECHNICAL ACCURACY\nThe lesson must not contain obvious technical errors, misleading explanations, or unsupported claims presented as facts.\n\nCHECK 8 — STANDALONE LESSON\nThe learner should be able to understand the lesson without needing another explanation or external material.\n\nReturn a result for EVERY check.\n\nThe overall result is PASS only if ALL checks pass.\n\nFor every failed check, explain:\n1. What failed.\n2. Why it failed.\n3. What should be changed during regeneration.\n\nReturn your evaluation in this exact JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"overall_pass\": true,\n  \"checks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"topic_accuracy\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"beginner_friendly\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"key_concepts\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"examples\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"jargon\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"teaching_flow\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"technical_accuracy\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"standalone\",\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"failed_checks\": [],\n  \"regeneration_feedback\": \"\"\n}",
