    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert instructional content creator for beginner learners in India.\n\nCreate a standalone beginner lesson about the topic provided below.\n\nLearner profile:\n- Recently completed 12th grade\n- Has no prior knowledge of the topic\n- Has limited English vocabulary\n- May not have an English-medium educational background\n- Wants to start learning AI\n\nTopic:\n{{ $json.topic }}\n\nAttempt:\n{{ $json.attempt || 1 }}\n\nPrevious evaluation feedback:\n{{ $json.feedback ? JSON.stringify($json.feedback) : \"No previous evaluation feedback. This is the first attempt.\" }}\n\nIf previous evaluation feedback is provided, carefully fix the issues identified by the evaluator while keeping the parts of the lesson that are already good.\n\nThe learner should be able to understand the topic from this lesson without needing another explanation.\n\nThe lesson must:\n1. Explain what the topic is in very simple language.\n2. Explain why the topic matters.\n3. Explain how it works step by step.\n4. Use at least one simple real-world analogy.\n5. Include at least one concrete technical example.\n6. Explain every necessary technical term before or when it is first used.\n7. Follow a clear teaching flow from simple concepts to more technical concepts.\n8. Avoid unnecessary jargon.\n9. Be technically accurate.\n10. End with a short recap of the key ideas.\n\nDo not assume the learner already knows programming, machine learning, embeddings, vector databases, APIs, or other AI terminology.\n\nWrite only the lesson content. Do not discuss these instructions.",
